[
    {
        "content": "<p>Is there a way to automatically generate the <code>LT</code>/<code>GT</code> type class implementations from <code>deriving Ord</code> or a manual implementation of <code>Ord</code>?</p>",
        "id": 581163332,
        "sender_full_name": "Leni Aniva",
        "timestamp": 1774282990
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>@loogle Ord, LT</p>",
        "id": 581168543,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1774284258
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"644391\">@loogle</span> Ord, LT</p>",
        "id": 581168595,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1774284271
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"search\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f50d\" role=\"img\" title=\"search\">:search:</span> <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Init/Data/Ord/Basic.html#ltOfOrd\">ltOfOrd</a>, <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Init/Data/Ord/Basic.html#Ord.toLT\">Ord.toLT</a>, and <a href=\"https://loogle.lean-lang.org/?q=Ord%2C%20LT\">19 more</a></p>",
        "id": 581168601,
        "sender_full_name": "loogle",
        "timestamp": 1774284272
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It seems that Core has 3 (equivalent) definitions doing this.</p>",
        "id": 581169094,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1774284403
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>when I did</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">default_instance</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instMysteryLt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mystery</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ltOfOrd</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>subsequent comparison of <code>Mystery</code> does not pick up on this default instance.</p>",
        "id": 581169156,
        "sender_full_name": "Leni Aniva",
        "timestamp": 1774284419
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It should work if you make it an instance:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mystery</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Ord</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mystery</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mystery</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ltOfOrd</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mystery</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∨</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- type-checks.</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 581169647,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1774284538
    }
]